1
00:00:00,958 --> 00:00:02,875
Stop messing with me.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,167
Seriously, stop it.

3
00:00:06,292 --> 00:00:09,375
I'll do my best.

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,750
Can you give me one more chance?

5
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:16,167
Awesome.

6
00:00:17,042 --> 00:00:21,125
You're so cute, Senpai.

7
00:00:48,125 --> 00:00:49,542
- Time to eat.
- Time to eat.

8
00:00:52,833 --> 00:00:53,833
So good.

9
00:00:53,917 --> 00:00:55,375
It's really good.

10
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,125
Feed me a bite.

11
00:00:58,125 --> 00:00:59,125
Here.

12
00:00:59,208 --> 00:01:00,708
So cute.

13
00:01:04,042 --> 00:01:05,167
It's so hot.

14
00:01:05,833 --> 00:01:07,042
Really hot.

15
00:01:10,042 --> 00:01:11,125
Are you sure about this?

16
00:01:11,250 --> 00:01:12,375
Yeah.

17
00:01:12,958 --> 00:01:14,518
- That's enough.
- Just a little longer.

18
00:01:14,542 --> 00:01:16,042
It's gonna drip.

19
00:01:16,167 --> 00:01:17,458
Hold still.

20
00:01:20,625 --> 00:01:21,875
Merry Christmas!

21
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,250
Merry Christmas!

22
00:01:27,833 --> 00:01:29,875
This is amazing, I'm so happy.

23
00:01:30,375 --> 00:01:31,542
So cute.

24
00:01:31,667 --> 00:01:32,750
What do you think?

25
00:01:32,875 --> 00:01:34,625
It's really cute.

26
00:01:35,917 --> 00:01:37,208
Look.

27
00:01:37,958 --> 00:01:39,250
Looking good.

28
00:02:30,792 --> 00:02:32,083
Morning.

29
00:02:34,042 --> 00:02:36,792
Morning.

30
00:02:47,083 --> 00:02:48,417
Wanna take a break?

31
00:02:48,542 --> 00:02:49,792
Sure.

32
00:02:54,833 --> 00:02:56,083
Here.

33
00:02:57,583 --> 00:02:58,958
Thanks.

34
00:03:01,042 --> 00:03:02,750
You really work hard every single day.

35
00:03:04,375 --> 00:03:05,375
Yeah...

36
00:03:06,250 --> 00:03:09,375
I practically begged my family...

37
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:11,458
To let me do what I love.

38
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:15,167
So I want to get some real results.

39
00:03:16,625 --> 00:03:20,208
Um... I have a favor to ask you, Senpai.

40
00:03:20,792 --> 00:03:21,917
Hmm?

41
00:03:22,042 --> 00:03:24,500
There's a practice match coming up.

42
00:03:25,458 --> 00:03:28,333
I really want to win that game.

43
00:03:28,458 --> 00:03:29,708
Yeah.

44
00:03:30,292 --> 00:03:31,875
If I win...

45
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,708
Will you go on a date with me, Senpai?

46
00:03:37,250 --> 00:03:39,583
I'd go with you even if you didn't win.

47
00:03:40,083 --> 00:03:41,417
I don't want that.

48
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:44,708
Huh?

49
00:03:44,833 --> 00:03:48,250
I want to win first, then go out with you.

50
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,792
Having a goal gives me more motivation.

51
00:03:57,458 --> 00:03:58,958
Okay.

52
00:03:59,083 --> 00:04:01,875
Then if you win, we'll go on a date.

53
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,125
Deal.

54
00:04:03,708 --> 00:04:05,042
It's a promise.

55
00:04:05,167 --> 00:04:06,542
I'm definitely gonna win.

56
00:04:08,917 --> 00:04:10,000
Yes!

57
00:04:12,458 --> 00:04:13,750
Thank you.

58
00:04:18,292 --> 00:04:20,667
I heard they're changing
rooms. The list is already up.

59
00:04:21,083 --> 00:04:22,250
Morning.

60
00:04:23,083 --> 00:04:25,500
The room change is what
they mentioned before, right?

61
00:04:25,833 --> 00:04:27,542
Yeah, they do it every year.

62
00:04:27,667 --> 00:04:29,708
But not everyone has to move.

63
00:04:29,958 --> 00:04:30,417
I see.

64
00:04:30,542 --> 00:04:33,375
Don't worry about it. Last
year, no one moved at all.

65
00:04:33,708 --> 00:04:34,125
Look.

66
00:04:34,250 --> 00:04:36,375
- We're still together.
- Oh, yeah.

67
00:04:38,042 --> 00:04:38,917
But we still have to move the furniture.

68
00:04:39,042 --> 00:04:40,042
Is there a lot?

69
00:04:40,083 --> 00:04:41,750
It's such a headache.

70
00:04:41,875 --> 00:04:43,500
Let's see what the list looks like.

71
00:04:51,917 --> 00:04:53,917
(Sofuu High School /
Dormitory Room Change Notice)

72
00:04:57,667 --> 00:05:00,307
"Room 208: Kishida Sui (No Change)
Kurobe Harutora -&gt; Room 103."

73
00:05:47,458 --> 00:05:50,292
"Hold on, Harutora-kun"
(Episode 5)

74
00:06:05,083 --> 00:06:06,976
Thanks for taking care
of me all this time, Senpai.

75
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,667
Ah...

76
00:06:11,750 --> 00:06:15,917
If you need anything,
you can always tell me.

77
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:22,708
I'll take this over first.

78
00:06:56,542 --> 00:06:57,875
No.

79
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,583
No, I don't want this!

80
00:07:00,083 --> 00:07:04,167
No... I really don't want to be in
a different room from Harutora.

81
00:07:04,292 --> 00:07:07,000
I really can't do this!

82
00:07:07,458 --> 00:07:09,958
Wait! What are you doing?

83
00:07:11,750 --> 00:07:12,333
Ah.

84
00:07:12,458 --> 00:07:14,167
Sorry.

85
00:07:14,292 --> 00:07:15,083
It's just that your pose just now...

86
00:07:15,208 --> 00:07:17,625
Looked exactly like my little
brother when he was a kid.

87
00:07:17,750 --> 00:07:19,150
I couldn't help but take a picture.

88
00:07:19,333 --> 00:07:20,708
Little brother?

89
00:07:21,333 --> 00:07:22,333
Oh.

90
00:07:28,542 --> 00:07:30,667
So cute!

91
00:07:32,625 --> 00:07:33,708
Wait a minute.

92
00:07:34,167 --> 00:07:35,875
How many people are in this?

93
00:07:36,417 --> 00:07:37,500
Ten.

94
00:07:38,375 --> 00:07:39,792
What?!

95
00:07:41,208 --> 00:07:42,833
I'm so jealous.

96
00:07:44,750 --> 00:07:47,333
They were cute when they were little.

97
00:07:47,583 --> 00:07:50,958
But every day was just fighting
and snatching things from each other.

98
00:07:51,333 --> 00:07:53,333
I couldn't even study at home.

99
00:07:55,292 --> 00:07:56,875
That sounds rough.

100
00:08:03,333 --> 00:08:04,333
Ah.

101
00:08:04,542 --> 00:08:06,782
There's only a little left.
Let's finish it all at once.

102
00:08:19,875 --> 00:08:21,833
There's some laundry detergent left.

103
00:08:22,083 --> 00:08:23,833
Harutora, you can have it.

104
00:08:40,292 --> 00:08:41,458
Okay.

105
00:08:58,542 --> 00:09:00,583
If you're missing anything, don't hesitate.

106
00:09:00,708 --> 00:09:02,583
Come back and get it anytime.

107
00:09:05,875 --> 00:09:07,250
Ah.

108
00:09:07,375 --> 00:09:09,125
We're in the same dorm anyway.

109
00:09:10,500 --> 00:09:14,708
We can see each other whenever we want.

110
00:09:23,333 --> 00:09:24,875
Harutora?

111
00:10:00,792 --> 00:10:02,458
I'm sorry, Harutora.

112
00:10:07,625 --> 00:10:09,792
Today's game...

113
00:10:10,875 --> 00:10:12,750
I won't be able to make it.

114
00:10:13,167 --> 00:10:15,083
It's fine, don't worry about it.

115
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:19,125
Good luck...

116
00:10:19,250 --> 00:10:20,333
Go!

117
00:10:23,375 --> 00:10:24,667
Go!

118
00:10:27,708 --> 00:10:28,875
Harutora!

119
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,500
Let's go!

120
00:10:33,750 --> 00:10:34,875
Get back on defense!

121
00:10:37,125 --> 00:10:38,250
Yes!

122
00:10:38,958 --> 00:10:40,625
Nice play!

123
00:10:40,750 --> 00:10:43,500
- Yeah, keep it up!
- Let's go again!

124
00:11:52,375 --> 00:11:54,875
I brought him. Look.

125
00:11:57,167 --> 00:11:58,167
Isn't he cute?

126
00:11:58,292 --> 00:11:59,750
Huh? What are you doing?

127
00:11:59,875 --> 00:12:01,458
Nice to meet you.

128
00:12:02,667 --> 00:12:03,958
Nice to meet you too.

129
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:08,917
Let me explain how to use
the shared kitchen first.

130
00:12:09,042 --> 00:12:11,667
Wash the dishes and
put them back after use.

131
00:12:11,792 --> 00:12:13,792
Write your name on
your stuff in the fridge.

132
00:12:13,917 --> 00:12:14,917
- Got it.
- Also...

133
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:18,625
There are shared
condiments and personal ones.

134
00:12:19,250 --> 00:12:21,458
And... pay attention to this.

135
00:12:22,333 --> 00:12:23,750
Kishida-senpai.

136
00:12:24,125 --> 00:12:27,125
- What's up?
- Where do I put this after washing it?

137
00:12:27,625 --> 00:12:31,042
That's shared. Just put it over there.

138
00:12:31,167 --> 00:12:32,167
Okay.

139
00:12:56,833 --> 00:12:59,125
So Sui likes this kind of stuff.

140
00:13:01,500 --> 00:13:05,708
Like I said at noon...

141
00:13:05,833 --> 00:13:08,417
The stuff in the fridge...
and the condiments...

142
00:13:08,542 --> 00:13:11,208
Are divided into shared and personal.

143
00:13:11,792 --> 00:13:15,583
If you don't know, ask before you eat it.

144
00:13:15,833 --> 00:13:17,000
I'm sorry.

145
00:13:17,583 --> 00:13:18,583
Hey, hey.

146
00:13:19,375 --> 00:13:23,000
Can you really put honey on your skin?

147
00:13:23,333 --> 00:13:25,708
Yeah, I use it sometimes.

148
00:13:25,833 --> 00:13:28,833
Seriously? Show me.

149
00:13:28,958 --> 00:13:29,833
Huh?

150
00:13:29,958 --> 00:13:30,958
Right now?

151
00:13:31,542 --> 00:13:32,750
Yeah.

152
00:13:37,250 --> 00:13:38,917
It's all sticky.

153
00:13:39,042 --> 00:13:40,042
Go wash it off.

154
00:13:40,167 --> 00:13:40,875
Yeah.

155
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,375
I'm gonna go take a shower.

156
00:13:43,208 --> 00:13:43,875
Okay, go ahead.

157
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,208
Take care.

158
00:13:45,708 --> 00:13:46,500
I'm heading out.

159
00:13:46,625 --> 00:13:47,625
I'm off.

160
00:13:47,750 --> 00:13:48,750
Okay.

161
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:00,667
Done!

162
00:14:22,417 --> 00:14:23,708
What?

163
00:14:24,458 --> 00:14:27,000
Um... where's Kurobe?

164
00:14:28,708 --> 00:14:30,333
Didn't he go to practice?

165
00:14:30,625 --> 00:14:32,375
I see. Thanks.

166
00:14:53,708 --> 00:14:56,167
Um... you're on the basketball team, right?

167
00:14:57,083 --> 00:14:58,292
Hello.

168
00:14:58,417 --> 00:14:59,559
Did you just finish practice?

169
00:14:59,583 --> 00:15:02,167
No, I finished a while ago.

170
00:15:02,542 --> 00:15:05,333
Um, is Kurobe still at the gym?

171
00:15:06,125 --> 00:15:07,708
- You mean Harutora?
- Yeah.

172
00:15:08,292 --> 00:15:10,542
I checked his room, but he's not back yet.

173
00:15:10,667 --> 00:15:13,750
He's been practicing really hard lately.

174
00:15:14,458 --> 00:15:17,833
Seems like he really
cares about the next game.

175
00:15:17,958 --> 00:15:18,958
I see.

176
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:22,500
I heard he absolutely has to win.

177
00:15:23,250 --> 00:15:24,625
Absolutely has to win?

178
00:15:27,875 --> 00:15:31,417
If I win this game,
will you go on a date with me?

179
00:15:31,542 --> 00:15:33,125
It's a promise.

180
00:15:33,250 --> 00:15:34,583
I'm definitely gonna win.

181
00:15:38,833 --> 00:15:40,417
What's wrong?

182
00:15:40,875 --> 00:15:42,625
Nothing. Thank you.

183
00:15:51,583 --> 00:15:52,958
Harutora...

184
00:16:10,250 --> 00:16:11,667
Okay...

185
00:16:13,667 --> 00:16:16,083
This is still a bit embarrassing.

186
00:16:16,542 --> 00:16:19,125
But I want to cheer him on...

187
00:16:20,083 --> 00:16:21,667
Whatever, this will do for now.

188
00:16:22,958 --> 00:16:24,542
Anyway.

189
00:16:25,417 --> 00:16:27,000
Um...

190
00:16:28,250 --> 00:16:30,125
Can I bother you for a sec?

191
00:16:32,125 --> 00:16:33,375
Huh?

192
00:16:36,417 --> 00:16:39,250
- Hurry up!
- Score!

193
00:16:39,542 --> 00:16:41,083
Sorry, I've never done laundry before.

194
00:16:41,208 --> 00:16:46,125
- Uh, separate the whites and colors first.
- Got it.

195
00:16:46,792 --> 00:16:49,042
Then check the pockets.

196
00:16:49,417 --> 00:16:52,500
By the way, I heard the
basketball team has a game today.

197
00:16:52,625 --> 00:16:54,184
The opponents are
supposed to be pretty tough.

198
00:16:54,208 --> 00:16:55,042
I heard they're really strong.

199
00:16:55,167 --> 00:16:56,833
They're a traditional powerhouse.

200
00:16:57,458 --> 00:16:59,083
I wonder if they can win.

201
00:16:59,208 --> 00:17:00,917
Go! Go!

202
00:17:01,042 --> 00:17:02,250
Push forward!

203
00:17:07,333 --> 00:17:08,833
Get back on defense, Harutora!

204
00:17:11,458 --> 00:17:13,375
Alright, that should do it.

205
00:17:13,500 --> 00:17:15,417
Now we just need to hang them up.

206
00:17:15,542 --> 00:17:16,583
Um...

207
00:17:16,708 --> 00:17:18,333
Is there something else?

208
00:17:18,458 --> 00:17:19,917
How do I hang them?

209
00:17:20,667 --> 00:17:24,542
What, the freshman doesn't
even know how to hang laundry?

210
00:17:24,667 --> 00:17:26,000
Well, what can you do?

211
00:17:26,125 --> 00:17:28,833
Sui, you guys share a room, so teach him.

212
00:17:28,958 --> 00:17:31,118
You're used to doing this
kind of stuff anyway, right?

213
00:17:32,625 --> 00:17:34,417
Sorry, I really can't today.

214
00:17:34,542 --> 00:17:36,208
I'll leave this to you.

215
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:37,875
I really can't today.

216
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:38,875
Huh?

217
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,083
Why not?

218
00:17:40,458 --> 00:17:42,417
Because today...

219
00:17:44,375 --> 00:17:46,792
Today is a really important game!

220
00:17:47,875 --> 00:17:48,875
Hey.

221
00:17:50,208 --> 00:17:52,042
An important game?

222
00:17:52,583 --> 00:17:54,583
Isn't it just a practice match today?

223
00:17:55,292 --> 00:17:56,684
(Kiriyama High School / Sofu High School)

224
00:17:56,708 --> 00:17:58,208
Let's go! Let's go!

225
00:18:01,542 --> 00:18:02,417
Pass!

226
00:18:02,542 --> 00:18:03,167
Focus!

227
00:18:03,292 --> 00:18:04,292
Mark your man!

228
00:18:05,458 --> 00:18:06,500
Get back on defense!

229
00:18:13,250 --> 00:18:14,083
Nice!

230
00:18:14,208 --> 00:18:15,625
Sink it!

231
00:18:22,125 --> 00:18:23,208
Great job!

232
00:18:24,458 --> 00:18:25,917
One more!

233
00:18:27,083 --> 00:18:29,000
Harutora, over here!

234
00:18:31,417 --> 00:18:33,125
Nice!

235
00:18:33,292 --> 00:18:34,167
Over there!

236
00:18:34,292 --> 00:18:35,292
Push!

237
00:18:35,333 --> 00:18:36,500
Looking good!

238
00:18:38,208 --> 00:18:39,708
Keep it up!

239
00:18:55,042 --> 00:18:56,500
Alright!

240
00:18:56,708 --> 00:18:57,292
Way to go, Harutora!

241
00:18:57,417 --> 00:18:58,542
Awesome!

242
00:18:59,250 --> 00:19:00,417
Nice shot!

243
00:19:13,417 --> 00:19:14,833
We won!

244
00:19:15,042 --> 00:19:16,125
Yeah.

245
00:19:17,083 --> 00:19:18,625
Then, as promised.

246
00:19:21,042 --> 00:19:22,125
Okay.

247
00:19:41,083 --> 00:19:42,625
What's wrong?

248
00:19:42,958 --> 00:19:44,833
I can't sleep at all.

249
00:19:45,208 --> 00:19:46,208
Huh?

250
00:20:14,167 --> 00:20:15,375
I'm sorry.

251
00:20:33,833 --> 00:20:35,125
Geez.

252
00:20:44,083 --> 00:20:46,667
Did something good happen to you, Senpai?

253
00:20:47,667 --> 00:20:48,667
Huh?

254
00:20:49,208 --> 00:20:52,042
No... it's nothing.

255
00:21:16,042 --> 00:21:17,292
Dai-chan.

256
00:21:18,958 --> 00:21:20,417
Are you heading out?

257
00:21:21,750 --> 00:21:23,208
Yeah... you could say that.

258
00:21:26,417 --> 00:21:27,667
Where to?

259
00:21:29,250 --> 00:21:32,917
Just... heading to Shibuya
to pick up some things.

260
00:21:33,042 --> 00:21:35,917
Oh, I was just thinking of
heading into the city too.

261
00:21:36,042 --> 00:21:36,708
Let's go together then.

262
00:21:36,833 --> 00:21:38,083
Huh?

263
00:21:38,792 --> 00:21:40,042
What?

264
00:21:41,708 --> 00:21:42,958
What's the matter?

265
00:21:44,625 --> 00:21:45,958
Because...

266
00:21:48,750 --> 00:21:50,958
I already have plans with someone else.

267
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:54,167
What?

268
00:21:55,208 --> 00:21:58,542
Don't tell me you're going on a date?

269
00:22:07,333 --> 00:22:08,833
Yeah, I'm going on a date.

270
00:22:18,833 --> 00:22:20,167
A date with who?

271
00:22:23,167 --> 00:22:24,375
Hmm?

272
00:23:30,708 --> 00:23:32,726
(Next Episode Preview)
You never used to run away like this.

273
00:23:32,750 --> 00:23:34,670
Why let your guard down
around someone like him?

274
00:23:34,708 --> 00:23:35,250
Finally...

275
00:23:35,375 --> 00:23:35,542
Huh?

276
00:23:35,667 --> 00:23:37,018
I heard you got a boyfriend. Is it true?

277
00:23:37,042 --> 00:23:37,833
What?

278
00:23:37,958 --> 00:23:39,750
Aren't we dating?

279
00:23:39,875 --> 00:23:43,250
You've been acting weird
lately. What's going on?

280
00:23:45,292 --> 00:23:46,792
I make the decisions for my own life.

281
00:23:46,917 --> 00:23:49,583
Are you really Harutora's friend?

282
00:23:49,708 --> 00:23:52,375
The time we spent apart, Senpai...

283
00:23:52,500 --> 00:23:54,667
really made me feel lonely.

284
00:23:54,792 --> 00:23:57,958
Even when we're apart, our
hearts are always with each other.

285
